      "sourceText": "因此，同一坡面或物体随着车辆接近，跨过4 m时可能改变高度差或可见点；这是需要观察的源码差异，目前没有确认发生实际交接故障。扩大半径会借用更多近场结果，缩小会更早使用较粗远场；它不改变代价地图大小、雷达量程或车辆半径。",
      "translatedText": "Therefore, as the vehicle approaches the same slope or object, the height difference or visible point may change when crossing 4 m; this is a source\\-code difference that needs to be observed, and no actual handover failure has been confirmed so far\\. Expanding the radius will borrow more near\\-field results, while shrinking it will use coarser far\\-field results earlier; it does not change the costmap size, radar range, or vehicle radius\\.",
